			<summary>These Regulations make provision in connection with the listed events regime set out in Part 4 of the Broadcasting Act 1996 (“the Act”) (as amended by the Media Act 2024). Listed events are sporting and other events of national interest designated by the Secretary of State in accordance with section 97 of the Act.</summary>
